# Licensing

This repository contains software under **multiple licenses**. Read the
section that applies to the files you use.

## Firmware — PolyForm Noncommercial 1.0.0

**License file:** [`LICENSE-firmware`](LICENSE-firmware)

Applies to the ESP32 Balboa gateway **firmware** and supporting project
files in this repository, including:

- `src/`
- `lib/` (except third-party files listed in [`THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md`](THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md))
- `boards/`, `scripts/`, `platformio.ini`, `spa_module.csv`
- `emulator/`, `docs/`, `wiki/`, and other repository documentation and tooling

Noncommercial use, modification, and distribution are allowed under
[`LICENSE-firmware`](LICENSE-firmware). **Commercial use** (including selling
products that include this firmware) requires **separate permission** from the
licensor. Open a [GitHub issue](https://github.com/shomanjk/esp32_balboa_spa/issues)
to inquire about commercial licensing.

**Required notice (PolyForm):** Copyright Jerrod Kogut (shomanjk)
(https://github.com/shomanjk/esp32_balboa_spa)

## Web UI — Apache License 2.0

The `balboa-spa/` git submodule is licensed under **Apache-2.0**. See
[`balboa-spa/LICENSE`](balboa-spa/LICENSE). That license allows commercial
use, modification, and distribution when its conditions are met.

## Third-party components

Bundled or linked components (vendored sources, PlatformIO libraries, npm
packages) retain their own licenses. See
[`THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md`](THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md).
